-- =========================================================================================================
-- s 431: Right of member or debenture holder to copies of accounts and reports: unquoted companies
-- =========================================================================================================

§ `s 431 Right of member or debenture holder to copies of accounts and reports: unquoted companies`

@ref s 430(7) Penalty for an offence under section 430(6) (src:5766)
DECLARE `s 431(1) document` IS ONE OF
    `s 431(1)(a) the company's last annual accounts`
    `s 431(1)(aa) the strategic report (if any) for the last financial year`
    `s 431(1)(b) the last directors' report`
    `s 431(1)(c) the auditor's report on those accounts`

-- src:5769 | 431 Right of member or debenture holder to copies of accounts and reports: unquoted companies
-- src:5770 | (1) A member of, or holder of debentures of, an unquoted company is entitled to be provided, on demand and without charge, with a copy of—
-- src:5771 | (a) the company's last annual accounts,
-- src:5772 | (aa) the strategic report (if any) for the last financial year,
-- src:5773 | (b) the last directors' report, ... and
-- src:5774 | (ba) . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . .
-- src:5775 | (c) the auditor's report on those accounts (including the statement on that report and (where applicable) on the strategic report ...).
@ref s 431(1) A member or debenture holder of an unquoted company is entitled to a copy on demand and without charge (src:5769-5775)
GIVEN `s 385 the company is an unquoted company` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
      `s 112 the person is a member of the company` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
      `the person is a holder of debentures of the company` IS A BOOLEAN
